      <h>168</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Additional constraints
--

- Projects cannot be published 
unless they have at least one invention.
Note that publishing a project implies 
that its components must be 
published auto-matically. 

- startMoment/endMoment must be a 
valid time interval in future 
wrt. the moment when a
invention is published.

- personMonths as the sum of active months 
of its components divided by the number 
of people in-volved.



bg=RED
</panel_attributes>
